        //    "first serves ... right ... then ... left".
        //    "order from the window to the aisle".
        //    Right side: Window is f, Aisle is d. Order: f, e, d.
        //    Left side: Window is a, Aisle is c. Order: a, b, c.
        //    So the full order for an attendant in a row is: f, e, d, a, b, c.
