        //    Then they move 1 row forward. Time: 1 second.
        //    Then they serve row 6 and row 8. Time: 6 seconds.
        //    Then they move 3 rows forward. Time: 3 seconds.
        //    ...

        // Let's define the state by the "block" of rows.
        // Block 1: Rows 1, 2 (Att 1) and 3, 4 (Att 2).
        //   Step 1: Serve 1, 3. (6s)
        //   Move 1. (1s)
